# Loaded by Vite whenever mode is `test` (i.e. every Vitest run), and it wins
# over .env and .env.local. Committed on purpose.
#
# src/lib/env.ts validates VITE_SUPABASE_* at module load and throws, so any
# test whose import graph reaches src/supabase.ts — usually transitively, via a
# service it never meant to touch — dies at collection when these are unset.
# That is why CI failed while the same test passed locally off .env.local.
#
# Placeholders, never real credentials: this also guarantees no test can talk to
# a real Supabase project. Tests that need Supabase behaviour mock it.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://placeholder.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=placeholder-anon-key
